                                "sense_id": "2e1eafe2-a96a-318f-80e5-5cefab0ea51d",
                                "text": "The Senate voted Tuesday night to confirm Pam Bondi as attorney general, making the tenacious litigator the latest official to help fill out President Donald Trump’s administration."
